[Music]  hello and welcome to the introductory  video of AWS database migration service  course offered by simply learn I spent  over 15 years working as a database  administrator for large investment banks  in London Sydney and New York supporting  Microsoft sequel server SAP ASE my  sequel and Oracle in 2015 I decided to  set up database of all my own company so  that I could concentrate on the areas of  technology that are most passionate  about cloud computing and databases  after using many of the major cloud  providers out there I decided to focus  solely on Amazon Web Services as it  truly is the best in the business in  this video we will go over some  interesting information about why this  service is so innovative and useful so  why are database migrations so difficult  database migrations are complex as they  involve so many different areas of an IT  department from sis admins to storage  from network administrators to DBAs and  migrations can be affected by a  multitude of different issues for  example slow Network speed the size of  the database or type migration deadlines  further complexity can be created if the  migration involves a change of database  platform all of these reasons and many  more make database migrations are  complex time-consuming and risky process  what is AWS database migration service  well AWS DMS is an innovative service  that aims to simplify migrating  databases into the cloud it allows you  to perform homogeneous migrations  like-for-like migrations for example  Oracle to Oracle or sequel server the  sequel server but it also allows you to  do heterogeneous migrations which are  cross-platform migrations for example  sequel server to MySQL  and you can use the service to  consolidate data from multiple sources  into a single database and what's more  you can also perform continuous data  replication with high availability so  that your database migration can take  place over a period of time rather than  in a short defined window sounds great  right but why would you want to migrate  your databases to the cloud well there  are many reasons but here are just a few  cost moving your database infrastructure  to AWS offers huge savings for  everything from instances to storage  managed services AWS offers a service  called RDS which provides full  management of the database so you don't  have to worry about backups maintenance  or high availability if you want to  switch database platforms to escape from  the expensive Oracle or Microsoft  licensing you can use AWS DMS to migrate  your platform to something much cheaper  for example MySQL or Amazon Aurora and  scalability the AWS cloud is completely  scalable so you can increase and reduce  resources based on demand and you only  pay for what you use simply learns AWS  database migration course comprises of  four hours of eLearning  quiz questions at the end of each lesson  and one evaluation project you will get  teachings assistance support from the  simply learned staff anytime during the  course and for the project's queries can  also be submitted at help and support on  WW simply learn comm or you can get  connected with the staff on simply talk  and the live chat options prerequisites  for this course are a knowledge of  databases and a limited understanding of  AWS products and services and that's  about it go ahead and begin AWS database  migration service course and get started  with the first lesson today happy  learning

